00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:33.150
{=4}Melissa's Shop!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.240
Please come in!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.250
Welcome, good sir!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:41.170
I made the right choice!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.540
My name is Melissa.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.460
Um, do you have any smoke bombs in stock?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.420
Of course, my good sir!
They're 20 gald each.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.340
How much is in there?

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.550
Let's see...

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.260
It's 60 gald.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.680
<i>That's </i>every coin he's got?!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.810
What a sorry old man!

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:02.520
After you basically scammed the man.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:03.730
Cold.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.610
Excuse me, sir?

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:10.360
Oh... um, could I get
a smoke bomb? Make that two.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.530
Yes. Here they are!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.820
And here's 40 gald.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.830
I'm afraid that in this case, it's not
the normal price. There's a surcharge.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.000
What?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.460
I still get high prices?!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.130
But I was cleared!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:32.170
It appears the bad rumors about you
will take another two months to stop.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.840
As they say, rumors fade in time.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.930
It'll take that long?!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:40.350
So that will be 50 gald, please.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.560
Okay. Fine.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.980
Wait a moment, sir!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:51.110
Before you leave, pay ten gald.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.990
Huh? F-For what?

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.200
Choosing <i>me</i>.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.700
Excuse me? For choosing you?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:19:02.450
You spoke with <i>the </i>Melissa of
Melissa's shop, so of course there's a fee.

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:05.210
Wait! Isn't this an item shop?

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.210
This is ridicu--

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.840
What did I expect?
Of course every NPC is shitty.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.600
Her merchant spirit was strong!
I could learn from her!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.770
Please don't.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.190
Aw, man. I should've
picked the shabby shop.

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.270
At least you learned something!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:31.020
Every rose has its thorn, right?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.650
You shouldn't just go by appearances.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.740
Huh? What is it?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.740
I will burn that in my brain.

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:59.430
They've finished the investigation
and removed the body, huh?

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:06.350
I understand it's hard to go in there,
but I can't go get it for you.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.900
Right.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:21.450
There it is. Just like Kamui said.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.250
It was right there.
How could I not have noticed it?

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:36.720
Hiro.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.010
Alicia!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:47.390
I <i>knew </i>you'd come back
here to get something!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:50.230
Hiro, the smoke bomb!

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.110
What?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.950
Just what was that, Hiro?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:03.240
Don't you just throw a smoke bomb?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.790
Dummy! This isn't a ninja manga!
You have to ignite the fuse!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.120
O-Oh.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.420
W-W-Wait. How?

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.710
Didn't it come with flint?

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.840
I see.

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:19.800
Wait. Flint? In the middle of a fight?

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.180
No time for that.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:32.270
Now, Hiro. You should always
test your tools beforehand.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.020
S-Sound advice.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.900
I'll do that next time.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:40.950
Good. But I'm sorry, Hiro.
There won't be a next time.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:43.660
Now die!

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:54.590
What?! Who the hell are you?!

00:21:54.590 --> 00:21:57.340
I-In this time of need, it must be...

00:21:57.340 --> 00:22:00.920
Tesla! You came to save me?

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.010
I'm Inquisitor Mizarisa.

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:09.890
Ya can't kill my wonderful bed-wetter!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:13.100
Wait, it's <i>you</i>?!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.370
Episode 6: Knife vs. Saw.
